AICSemi AIC8800D80 firmware
===========================

Source: https://github.com/radxa-pkg/aic8800
Release: 5.0+git20260123.5f7be68d-7
Commit: 6e07604

The files under USB/aic8800D80 were copied from:

  src/USB/driver_fw/fw/aic8800D80

Licensing and provenance
------------------------

COPYRIGHT.radxa.original is a byte-for-byte copy of Radxa's
debian/copyright. Its Files patterns refer to paths in Radxa's original
package, not to paths in this image overlay.

The imported firmware and configuration files originated below src/ and are
therefore covered by the original src/* paragraph, which Radxa declares as
GPL-2. This import preserves Radxa's package metadata; it does not change the
license or claim that Radxa authored every imported vendor file.

The image build installs this directory below /usr/lib/firmware. Debian's
merged-/usr layout exposes the same files below /lib/firmware, which matches
the firmware path used by the patched Radxa driver.
